strong=\"H4784\"the|strong=\"H8104\"Most|strong=\"H5945\"High|strong=\"H5945\"God|strong=\"H3808\",  \nand|strong=\"H8104\"didn’t keep|strong=\"H8104\"his|strong=\"H8104\"testimonies|strong=\"H5713\",   \n"},{"number":57,"text":"but turned|strong=\"H2015\"back|strong=\"H5472\", and|strong=\"H7198\"dealt treacherously like|strong=\"H2015\"their|strong=\"H2015\"fathers.  \nThey were twisted like|strong=\"H2015\"a|strong=\"H3068\"deceitful|strong=\"H7423\"bow|strong=\"H7198\".   \n"},{"number":58,"text":"For|strong=\"H1116\"they provoked|strong=\"H3707\"him|strong=\"H7065\"to|strong=\"H1116\"anger|strong=\"H3707\"with|strong=\"H7065\"their high|strong=\"H1116\"places|strong=\"H1116\",  \nand|strong=\"H1116\"moved him|strong=\"H7065\"to|strong=\"H1116\"jealousy|strong=\"H7065\"with|strong=\"H7065\"their engraved|strong=\"H6456\"images|strong=\"H6456\".   \n"},{"number":59,"text":"When|strong=\"H8085\"God heard|strong=\"H8085\"this|strong=\"H5674\", he|strong=\"H3478\"was|strong=\"H3478\"angry|strong=\"H5674\",  \nand|strong=\"H3478\"greatly|strong=\"H3966\"abhorred|strong=\"H3988\"Israel|strong=\"H3478\",   \n"},{"number":60,"text":"so that|strong=\"H4908\"he abandoned|strong=\"H5203\"the|strong=\"H5203\"tent of|strong=\"H4908\"Shiloh|strong=\"H7887\",  \nthe|strong=\"H5203\"tent which he placed|strong=\"H7931\"among|strong=\"H7931\"men,   \n"},{"number":61,"text":"and|strong=\"H3027\"delivered|strong=\"H5414\"his|strong=\"H5414\"strength|strong=\"H5797\"into|strong=\"H3027\"captivity|strong=\"H7628\",  \nhis|strong=\"H5414\"glory|strong=\"H8597\"into|strong=\"H3027\"the|strong=\"H5414\"adversary|strong=\"H6862\"’s hand|strong=\"H3027\".   \n"},{"number":62,"text":"He|strong=\"H5971\"also|strong=\"H5971\"gave|strong=\"H5462\"his|strong=\"H5674\"people|strong=\"H5971\"over|strong=\"H5674\"to|strong=\"H5674\"the|strong=\"H5674\"sword|strong=\"H2719\",  \nand|strong=\"H5971\"was|strong=\"H5159\"angry|strong=\"H5674\"with|strong=\"H5971\"his|strong=\"H5674\"inheritance|strong=\"H5159\".   \n"},{"number":63,"text":"Fire devoured their|strong=\"H3808\"young men.  \nTheir|strong=\"H3808\"virgins|strong=\"H1330\"had|strong=\"H3808\"no|strong=\"H3808\"wedding|strong=\"H1984\"song.   \n"},{"number":64,"text":"Their|strong=\"H3808\"priests|strong=\"H3548\"fell|strong=\"H5307\"by|strong=\"H3808\"the|strong=\"H3548\"sword|strong=\"H2719\",  \nand|strong=\"H3548\"their|strong=\"H3808\"widows couldn’t weep|strong=\"H1058\".   \n"},{"number":65,"text":"Then the Lord awakened|strong=\"H3364\"as|strong=\"H3364\"one|strong=\"H1368\"out|strong=\"H7442\"of|strong=\"H1368\"sleep|strong=\"H3463\",  \nlike|strong=\"H1368\"a|strong=\"H3068\"mighty|strong=\"H1368\"man|strong=\"H1368\"who|strong=\"H1368\"shouts|strong=\"H7442\"by reason of|strong=\"H1368\"wine|strong=\"H3196\".   \n"},{"number":66,"text":"He|strong=\"H5414\"struck|strong=\"H5221\"his|strong=\"H5414\"adversaries|strong=\"H6862\"backward.  \nHe|strong=\"H5414\"put|strong=\"H5414\"them|strong=\"H5414\"to|strong=\"H5414\"a|strong=\"H3068\"perpetual|strong=\"H5769\"reproach|strong=\"H2781\".   \n"},{"number":67,"text":"Moreover he|strong=\"H3808\"rejected|strong=\"H3988\"the|strong=\"H3808\"tent of|strong=\"H7626\"Joseph|strong=\"H3130\",  \nand|strong=\"H7626\"didn’t choose the|strong=\"H3808\"tribe|strong=\"H7626\"of|strong=\"H7626\"Ephraim,   \n"},{"number":68,"text":"But chose the|strong=\"H3063\"tribe|strong=\"H7626\"of|strong=\"H7626\"Judah|strong=\"H3063\",  \nMount|strong=\"H2022\"Zion|strong=\"H6726\"which|strong=\"H2022\"he|strong=\"H3063\"loved.   \n"},{"number":69,"text":"He|strong=\"H1129\"built|strong=\"H1129\"his|strong=\"H1129\"sanctuary|strong=\"H4720\"like|strong=\"H3644\"the|strong=\"H1129\"heights|strong=\"H7311\",  \nlike|strong=\"H3644\"the|strong=\"H1129\"earth which|strong=\"H4720\"he|strong=\"H1129\"has established|strong=\"H3245\"forever|strong=\"H5769\".   \n"},{"number":70,"text":"He|strong=\"H1732\"also|strong=\"H1732\"chose David|strong=\"H1732\"his|strong=\"H3947\"servant|strong=\"H5650\",  \nand|strong=\"H1732\"took|strong=\"H3947\"him|strong=\"H3947\"from|strong=\"H3947\"the|strong=\"H3947\"sheepfolds|strong=\"H6629\";   \n"},{"number":71,"text":"from|strong=\"H3478\"following the|strong=\"H7462\"ewes|strong=\"H5763\"that|strong=\"H5971\"have|strong=\"H5971\"their|strong=\"H3290\"young|strong=\"H5763\",  \nhe|strong=\"H3478\"brought|strong=\"H3478\"him to|strong=\"H3478\"be|strong=\"H3478\"the|strong=\"H7462\"shepherd|strong=\"H7462\"of|strong=\"H5971\"Jacob|strong=\"H3290\", his|strong=\"H3478\"people|strong=\"H5971\",  \nand|strong=\"H3478\"Israel|strong=\"H3478\", his|strong=\"H3478\"inheritance|strong=\"H5159\".   \n"},{"number":72,"text":"So he|strong=\"H8394\"was|strong=\"H3824\"their|strong=\"H7462\"shepherd|strong=\"H7462\"according to|strong=\"H3824\"the|strong=\"H7462\"integrity|strong=\"H8537\"of|strong=\"H3709\"his|strong=\"H7462\"heart|strong=\"H3824\",  \nand|strong=\"H3824\"guided|strong=\"H5148\"them|strong=\"H5148\"by|strong=\"H3824\"the|strong=\"H7462\"skillfulness of|strong=\"H3709\"his|strong=\"H7462\"hands|strong=\"H3709\".   \n"}]}
